{{Passive skill box|Unstoppable Hero}}

'''Unstoppable Hero''' is an [[Ascendancy passive skill]] for the [[Champion]] that grants increased [[attack speed]] and more [[Armour]] and [[Evasion]] Rating for each stack of [[Fortification]] above the maximum limit of 20.

==Ruthless mode==
Unstoppable Hero in [[Ruthless mode]] is unchanged.

==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.26.0|
* The Unstoppable Hero Ascendancy Passive Skill no longer causes Nearby Allies to count as having Fortification equal to yours. It now grants 3% more Armour and Evasion Rating per Fortification above 20, and 3% increased Attack Speed per Fortification above 20.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.25.0|
* The Unstoppable Hero Ascendancy Passive Skill has swapped positions with [[Fortitude]]. Unstoppable Hero no longer grants 20% increased Attack Speed while Fortified, +500 to Armour and Evasion Rating while Fortified, or "Cannot be Stunned while Fortified". Instead, it now provides "Nearby Allies count as having Fortification equal to yours".
}}
{{Version history table row|3.22.0|
* The {{psl|Unstoppable Hero}} and {{psl|Fortitude}} Ascendancy Passive Skills have swapped position on the Champion Ascendancy in Ruthless.
* No longer provides "20% increased Attack Speed while Fortified", "+500 to Armour and Evasion Rating while Fortified" or "Cannot be Stunned while Fortified" in Ruthless. It now provides "Nearby Allies count as having Fortification equal to yours."
}}
{{Version history table row|3.13.0|
* Increased attack speed while you have fortify from 10% to 20%
* Reduced armour and evasion rating while you have fortify from 1000 to 500
* Removed {{c|mod|30% increased Attack Damage while you have Fortify}}
}}
{{Version history table row|3.7.0|
* Now grants 30% increased attack damage (rather than melee damage) while you have fortify.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.2.0|
* Removed {{c|mod|30% increased Melee Damage while you have Fortify}}.
* Added {{c|mod|+1000 to Armour and Evasion while you have Fortify}} and {{c|mod|Cannot be Stunned while you have Fortify}}
}}
{{Version history table row|2.3.0|
* Bonuses changed:
** Removed: 8% increased Movement Speed while you have Fortify, 10% increased effect of Fortify on you
** Added: 30% increased Armour and Evasion while you have Fortify, 30% increased Melee Damage while you have Fortify
}}
{{Version history table row|2.2.0|
* Added to the game.
}}
{{Version history table end}}
